            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"93226e2d-9548-4ada-9486-9a7129abf988\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>Benvenuto! In questa lezione creerai il tuo primo programma con JavaScript e lo vedrai prendere vita.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 151532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I linguaggi di programmazione come JavaScript ti permettono di scrivere programmi che i computer possono eseguire.</p><p>Fai clic sul frammento di codice <code>console.log(\"Hello, World\");</code> per aggiungerlo all'editor di codice. Poi fai clic sul pulsante qui sotto per eseguire il programma.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, World&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, World\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console.log(\"Hello, World\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 151533,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I programmi spesso devono ricordare delle informazioni. Le variabili lo rendono possibile.</p><p>Aggiungi lo snippet di codice che memorizza <code>\"Virginia\"</code> in una variabile chiamata <code>firstName</code>. Poi, fai clic sul pulsante qui sotto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const firstName = \"Virginia\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 151534,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ora il programma può usare la variabile <code>firstName</code>.</p><p>Aggiungi <code>firstName</code> alla riga incompleta, poi esegui il programma.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", firstName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>firstName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 151535,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un programma può eseguire diverse istruzioni in ordine.</p><p>Usa i frammenti di codice per formare <code>console.log(\"How are you?\");</code> nell'editor di codice. Poi fai clic sul pulsante qui sotto per vedere il risultato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", firstName);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;How are you?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"How are you?\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console.log</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>\"How are you?\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
